      "title": "range 0:00.01 to 0:14.36",
      "text": "So I didn't map out everything. I think I tried to give an idea on part of the voice, at least. No, I didn't map everything. There's also maybe some of the drum that you may want to map for and so on. The beginning, I think, is very weak in terms of following what we need to follow. So if you could try somehow to use this feedback to try to do your best, that would be awesome. Try to do something that makes sense in light of this feedback.",
